# Notification for dropped operating system support.
# "{ -brand-short-name }" will be replaced with the localized name of the browser, e.g. "Tor Browser".
# "14.0" refers to the browser versions number: Tor Browser 14.0.
# "macOS" is a brand name, and 10.15 is the macOS version number.
dropped-support-notification-macos-version-less-than-10-15 = Ďalšia hlavná verzia { -brand-short-name } (14.0) už nebude podporovať túto verziu systému macOS. Inovujte na systém macOS 10.15 alebo novší do 1. októbra 2024, aby ste mohli naďalej dostávať dôležité aktualizácie zabezpečenia.
# Notification for dropped operating system support.
# "{ -brand-short-name }" will be replaced with the localized name of the browser, e.g. "Tor Browser".
# "macOS" is a brand name, and 10.15 is the macOS version number.
